2	//
3	// Gathers: AppState (DB + outbound HTTP client), form body (authorization request parameters)
4	// Processes: client lookup (with ATProto URL-client_id metadata resolution on a cache miss)
5	//            → redirect_uri validation → param validation → DB store
6	// Returns:
7	//   POST: 201 JSON { request_uri, expires_in } on success
8	//         400 JSON { error, error_description } on invalid request (RFC 9126 §2.3)
