10	//! `POST /oauth/par` — Pushed Authorization Requests (RFC 9126).
11	//!
12	//! For discoverable (https-URL) client_ids, a private-use-scheme `redirect_uri` must be the
13	//! client_id host's FQDN in reverse order (`invalid_redirect_uri` otherwise), matching
14	//! bsky.social's enforcement of the atproto OAuth rule; the check is shared with the
15	//! authorization endpoint via `auth/oauth_client_resolution.rs`.
16	//!
17	//! Accepts and stores `response_mode` (`query`/`fragment`; anything else is `invalid_request`)
18	//! for the authorization endpoint to honor on its redirects.
19	
