2	//
3	// Rotation is where a session quietly dies. A client that refreshes correctly but gets
4	// `invalid_grant` back has no recovery path: it is holding a token the server has already
5	// invalidated, so it logs the user out. That makes the failure modes here indistinguishable
6	// from "the app randomly signed me out", which is exactly how they go unreported for months.
